.profile
Encompassing a wide variety of technologies,
my professional experience spans front-end development,
server and microservice software,
database systems,
and cloud infrastructure.
My interests, however, extend beyond,
and I'm always eager to learn new technologies.
I endeavor to write pragmatic, maintainable code
that is readily testable
and lends itself to team collaboration and iteration.
